<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Hasta Siempre (Nathalie Cardone, produced by Laurent Boutonnat)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recording</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Che Guevara (Hasta Siempre) (Inés Rivero)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recording (on the compilation Hit Express 4, 1998)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Left Right Left, Malayalam film</span><span class="sg-chain-h">its opening lines rendered as the prologue of a song</span></li></ul></section>
